```typescript
const handleDelete = useCallback(async () => {
  if (!payload?.event.isOwn) return;

  try {
    await MatrixService.deleteMessage(roomId, payload.event);
    setEditPayload(null);
    setReplyPayload(null);
  } catch (error) {
    console.error("Failed to delete message:", error);
  } finally {
    ref.current?.dismiss();
  }
}, [payload, roomId, setEditPayload, setReplyPayload]);
```
**Current Behavior**: Only the message owner can delete their own messages. The delete action dismisses the bottom sheet and calls `room.redact()`.

